[ NOTE: extract queries out of functions ]

if you ever need to extract queries out of functions, you could use a quick script e.g.

rg -g!'query/*' -g'*.go' '`' # search for the backtick character in all source files not in query/

with extra context:

CONTEXT=3
rg -g!'query/*' -g'*.go' -A "$CONTEXT" '`'

[ END NOTE ]

